      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AARDIES A STAR NZ (6) sets the benchmark after winning here last start in a sharp 1:54.0 mile rate, and his record of three wins and one placing from six runs at the Albion Park 1660m is the strongest profile in the race. The prior third to Bettor One reads better than the beaten margin after he was hampered near 300m, and he also holds a clear recent edge over SWEET TIMES. BLING YOUR A GAME (3) is the immediate threat after an odds-on maiden win here by over 12 metres in a 1:55.1 mile rate, backed by a second to Uncle Nolan the start before. AARDIES A MOVER NZ (4) won his debut here as favourite and has upside, though he has less exposed depth than the top pair. SWEET TIMES (5) drops out of black type after a Listed third at Redcliffe, and that class relief gives him a genuine place-to-win fringe if he transfers that form back to Albion Park.",
